# 32_hypnagogic_visions.ledc — Hypnagogic Visionary Field (amber Ganzfeld), ~27 min
# ALTERED STATE: hypnagogia — the closed-eye visionary threshold between waking and sleep,
#   where spontaneous imagery ("hypnagogic phosphenes / form constants") arises. Target arc:
#   alpha 10 Hz induction -> theta 6 Hz hold (the imagery band) -> gentle return to alpha.
#
# V2 FEATURES USED (and why):
#   * LED env=1 (SINE flicker gate) — a soft sinusoidal luminance gate is the gentlest visual
#     driver and the standard for a comfortable eyes-closed Ganzfeld field (playbook B2/B7);
#     hard square edges fatigue and inject harmonics into the percept.
#   * LED jitter (0.6 Hz, 30 s wander) — THE showcase feature here. A dead-steady flicker
#     habituates within minutes and the hypnagogic imagery fades; a slow non-repeating wander
#     of the flicker RATE keeps the retinal/cortical drive novel, sustaining the imagery
#     (playbook A3/§0.3 "anti-habituation dither", approximated per guidelines §12).
#   * Slow brightness breathing LFO (0.1 Hz sine on the master brightness) during the hold —
#     a coherence-breath pace layered under the flicker (guidelines §5).
#
# RESEARCH / PATENT CITATION:
#   Ganzfeld eyes-closed red/amber bias + form-constant imagery: entrainment_techniques_playbook.md
#   B7 (eyelid passes ~14.5% at 700 nm, <=3% below 580 nm -> warm light only reaches the closed eye)
#   and B6 (form constants strongest ~10 Hz). Anti-habituation dither: playbook A3 / §0.3.
#   All core concepts are expired prior art (Tranquil Times US 4,777,937 Ganzfeld+pink noise,
#   Martel US 5,070,399 colour-intensity 2-20 Hz — patent_landscape_ave.md).
#
# SAFETY / CONTRAINDICATIONS:
#   Do NOT use if you have photosensitive epilepsy, a seizure disorder, or a history of photic
#   migraine. Do not use while driving or operating machinery. Stop if you feel dizzy or unwell.
#   This is an EXPERIENTIAL relaxation/imagery tool, NOT a medical device or treatment.
#   All flicker is 6-10 Hz (well BELOW the 15-25 Hz photosensitive danger band); warm amber
#   (not saturated red); brightness dim (<=28%) with a floor; light ramps in 15 s / out 2 min;
#   audio fades in 60 s. Eyes closed, lying or reclining.
#
# Duration: ~27 min.  LED cols: time freq duty bright R G B mask env phase attack jitter
#   (env 1 = sine gate; jitter <amp>:<period_ms>).  Audio: A time freq pan vol mod [ch] [freqR] [wave]
# Ramp convention = animate-on-start (the >/* prefix sits where a segment BEGINS).

# --- Induction / alpha 10 Hz (00:00-02:00): amber field + audio fade in ---
0 10 50 >0 255 140 0 10 1 0 3 0.6:30000     # amber sine-gated 10 Hz field, flicker jitter 0.6 Hz/30 s; bright fade-in
A 0 246 0 >0 0 1 256 0                       # ch1 binaural theta-bridge: carrier 246 / freqR 256 => 10 Hz beat; vol fade-in
A 0 200 0 >0 0 2 0 5                         # ch2 soft pink-noise bed; vol fade-in
S 3000 default 47 "Eyes closed. Let the amber field fill your vision, and simply watch what arises."
15000 10 50 28 255 140 0 10 1 0 3 0.6:30000  # brightness reaches 28% (>=10 s ramp-in)
A 60000 246 0 90 0 1 256 0                   # ch1 vol settled 45
A 60000 200 0 40 0 2 0 5                     # ch2 pink settled 20 (soft bed)

# --- Deepen (02:00-08:00): glide alpha 10 -> theta 6 Hz (~0.67 Hz/min) ---
A 120000 >246 0 90 0 1 256 0                 # carrier ramps 246->250 (beat 10->6); freqR held (not interpolatable)
120000 >10 50 28 255 140 0 10 1 0 3 0.6:30000   # LED flicker tracks the beat 10->6, jitter continues
S 120000 default 47 "Drifting down into the twilight. Images may drift and shift; let them come and go."

# --- Hold / theta 6 Hz (08:00-22:00 = 14 min): the imagery band, jitter sustains novelty ---
A 480000 250 0 90 0 1 256 0                  # beat settled 6 Hz (carrier 250 / freqR 256), held
480000 6 50 ~20:32:10000 255 140 0 10 1 0 3 0.6:30000  # 6 Hz sine field, 0.1 Hz brightness breath, jitter on
S 480000 default 47 "Rest here at the threshold. Faces, patterns, landscapes — witness them without grasping."
S 900000 default 47 "Let the slow breath of the light carry you. The images renew themselves; stay soft and curious."

# --- Return (22:00-25:00): glide theta 6 -> alpha 9 Hz ---
A 1320000 >250 0 90 0 1 256 0               # carrier ramps 250->247 (beat 6->9)
1320000 >6 50 28 255 140 0 10 1 0 3 0.6:30000   # LED 6->9 lockstep; breathing LFO dropped, steady dim
S 1320000 default 47 "Gently rising now, carrying the imagery with you toward waking clarity."

# --- Soft close (25:00-27:00): field + audio fade to 0 (jitter released) ---
A 1500000 247 0 >90 0 1 256 0               # beat at alpha 9; vol ramp-out 45->0
1500000 9 50 >28 255 140 0 10 1 0 3 0        # brightness ramp-out 28->0, jitter released
A 1500000 200 0 >40 0 2 0 5                  # pink bed fade 20->0
S 1500000 default 47 "The field fades. Open your eyes when you are ready, calm and rested."
A 1620000 247 0 0 0 1 256 0                  # end: ch1 vol 0
1620000 9 50 0 255 140 0 10 1 0 3 0          # end: brightness 0
A 1620000 200 0 0 0 2 0 5                    # end: pink vol 0
